| `test/` | 966 | Troy Goode 54%, Douglas Wilson 39% | Troy Goode |
| `.github/` | 374 | Douglas Wilson 32%, Íñigo Marquínez Prado 25%, Sebastian Beltran 17%, Ulises Gascón 12% | None |
| root files | 417 | Troy Goode 32%, Douglas Wilson 28%, Jon Church 17% | None |

Within the root files, a few single files do have a majority holder, but these are small files and a per-file owner would be noise:
- `.eslintrc.yml`, `.gitignore`, `HISTORY.md` and `LICENSE` are mostly Douglas Wilson.
- `README.md` is 42% Troy Goode, so no owner.
- `package.json` is 48% Douglas Wilson, just under half.

